y shouldn't do never  mind the fact that most teams have guys  who get suspended for ped violations  when it comes to the patriots that's a  sore subject and maybe the wisdom in all  of this even though edelman isn't  telling the truth about the league rules  the wisdom is he's ended the discussion  ended the conversation and ended any  speculation about why it is that he  ended up being suspended for violating  the ped policy  hi i'm mike tarico and thanks for  watching make sure to hit subscribe for  the latest news and highlights from nbc  sports
 

